{"about_the_game":"<strong>Plates of Peril</strong> is a dark <strong>dungeon-cooking</strong> game where you gather ingredients, prepare dishes, and serve them to demanding customers. <u><i>Play solo or team up with up to 3 friends</i></u> as you survive the chaos to <strong>become the ultimate chef in a dungeon full of danger.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/pop_explore_store.png?t=1739233857\" /><br><strong>Explore the procedurally generated dungeons to gather ingredients for your dishes.<br>But watch out for traps, and be careful, you'll never know who or what is hiding.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/pop_cook_store.png?t=1739233857\" /><br><strong>Combine your ingredients to make unique dishes and boost your reputation as a chef of the dungeon!</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/pop_boss_store.png?t=1739233857\" /><br><strong>Occasionally, your boss will drop by for a taste test.<br>Serve perfection, or suffer the consequences.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/pop_friends_store.png?t=1739233857\" /><br><strong>Team up with up to 3 friends in chaotic co-op gameplay!<br>Work together to gather ingredients, cook dishes, and survive the dungeon\u2019s peril.<br>Who is the best chef?</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/pop_buffs_store.png?t=1739233857\" /><br><strong>Instead of serving food to customers, eat your favorite foods for strategic stat boosts.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/pop_replayability_store.png?t=1739233857\" /><br><strong>With changing dungeon layouts and customer needs, no two runs are the same.</strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451820?t=1739233857","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451820?t=1739233857","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/3a5c150a9411be39bc3fbc212fde84d2377bb6a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739233857","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/3a5c150a9411be39bc3fbc212fde84d2377bb6a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739233857","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Plates of Peril contains mild horror themes, possible consumption of alcohol, and occasional acts of violence."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<strong>Plates of Peril</strong> is a dark <strong>dungeon-cooking</strong> game where you gather ingredients, prepare dishes, and serve them to demanding customers. <u><i>Play solo or team up with up to 3 friends</i></u> as you survive the chaos to <strong>become the ultimate chef in a dungeon full of danger.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/pop_explore_store.png?t=1739233857\" /><br><strong>Explore the procedurally generated dungeons to gather ingredients for your dishes.<br>But watch out for traps, and be careful, you'll never know who or what is hiding.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/pop_cook_store.png?t=1739233857\" /><br><strong>Combine your ingredients to make unique dishes and boost your reputation as a chef of the dungeon!</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/pop_boss_store.png?t=1739233857\" /><br><strong>Occasionally, your boss will drop by for a taste test.<br>Serve perfection, or suffer the consequences.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/pop_friends_store.png?t=1739233857\" /><br><strong>Team up with up to 3 friends in chaotic co-op gameplay!<br>Work together to gather ingredients, cook dishes, and survive the dungeon\u2019s peril.<br>Who is the best chef?</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/pop_buffs_store.png?t=1739233857\" /><br><strong>Instead of serving food to customers, eat your favorite foods for strategic stat boosts.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/extras/pop_replayability_store.png?t=1739233857\" /><br><strong>With changing dungeon layouts and customer needs, no two runs are the same.</strong>","developers":["RAPhAEL!!!"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451820/header.jpg?t=1739233857","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257088748,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257088748/movie480.mp4?t=1737142691","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257088748/movie_max.mp4?t=1737142691"},"name":"Plates Of Peril Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257088748/c86eb9d7cca9b5c9deb23b02928221ad96c2dd4f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=173